# =====================================================================
#  Whitelist: GitHub receives ONLY the files needed to host the site.
#  Everything used to *generate* exams locally stays off GitHub.
#
#  How it works: ignore everything by default, then allow back exactly
#  what the website needs. New exam .html files and new images under
#  dependencies/assets/ are included automatically; new generator files
#  (in dependencies/_build/ or dependencies/content/) are excluded.
# =====================================================================

# 1) Ignore everything at the repo root...
/*

# 2) ...then allow back the files the site needs:
!/.gitignore
!/practice_exam_hub.html
!/vercel.json
!/dependencies/

# 3) Inside dependencies/, ignore everything...
dependencies/*

# 4) ...except the assets folder and the exam HTML files:
!dependencies/assets/
!dependencies/*.html
